{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56910","headline":"湖南童谣 · 佚名","name":"湖南童谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖南有长街，栽柳不栽槐。\n百姓任奔窜，槌芒织草鞵。\n（《十国春秋》卷六九《楚废王世家》）（按：《全唐诗》卷八七八收此谣爲七言四句，此作五言四句，与前不同，故重收之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}